'''Portals''' are enigmatic entities that appear {{dlc|a+nr}} on many floors/{{dlc+|r}} only in {{s|The Void}}{{dlc-}}. They continuously spawn enemies until they are destroyed or spawn a certain number of enemies.

Portals spawn different enemies depending on the floor they appear on.

In {{s|The Void}}, Portals spawn enemies based on the theme of the room they are in.

